---
layout: base.njk
title: Page not found
description: There's no page at this address on wavgen.ca. Head back home or pick a section.
permalink: /404.html
noindex: true
sitemap: false
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
{#
404.njk -> /404.html, the "page not found" page.
- GitHub Pages serves /404.html, with HTTP status 404, for any path that doesn't
  exist, at whatever URL was requested (e.g. /music/nope/). So every link and asset
  here must be root-absolute ("/music/", "/css/style.css"), never relative. base.njk
  and the nav already follow that rule. `npm run dev` (eleventy --serve) serves it
  for missing paths too.
- noindex, sitemap: false and eleventyExcludeFromCollections keep it out of search,
  the sitemap and every collection-driven listing.
- The section tiles are built from src/_data/navigation.js, so they follow the menu.
- Uses only Tailwind classes that already appear elsewhere in src/, so building it
  doesn't change the committed src/css/style.css. Page-specific styling lives in the
  <style> block at the bottom.
#}

{# Icons for the section tiles, keyed by the `icon` field in navigation.js (same glyphs as the home page cards) #}
